WEBVTT

00:15.390 --> 00:17.892
Huh?

00:17.976 --> 00:19.853
A SPRING BREEZE BLOWS
THROUGH THE YOZAKURAS

00:20.437 --> 00:23.732
Sui! You know that Asano kid
who married into the Yozakura family?

00:23.815 --> 00:25.817
Seems like he's pretty awesome!

00:28.903 --> 00:30.572
Not interested, Oga.

00:31.156 --> 00:33.742
For us,
everything other than our mission...

00:34.701 --> 00:35.994
is of no use.

00:51.843 --> 00:58.433
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

02:18.304 --> 02:19.305
PLAN 7
GOVERNMENT SPIES

02:19.389 --> 02:22.308
<i>Hello? Big Bro Taiyo? </i>

02:22.392 --> 02:24.060
Hey, Nanao.

02:24.144 --> 02:25.395
What's up?

02:25.478 --> 02:27.438
<i>I'm out right now.</i>

02:27.522 --> 02:29.899
<i>Would you mind coming to pick me up?</i>

02:29.983 --> 02:31.401
Huh? Sure.

02:31.985 --> 02:32.986
No problem.

02:38.449 --> 02:40.702
So where should I go?

02:40.785 --> 02:42.162
<i>Well...</i>

02:46.958 --> 02:48.710
The Evil Laboratory?

02:48.793 --> 02:49.794
<i>Excuse me?</i>

02:50.753 --> 02:55.341
<i>There's a lab where they secretly</i>
<i>manufacture bioweapons like toxic gas.</i>

02:55.842 --> 02:59.387
<i>And I came here undercover on a mission</i>
<i>to neutralize this new weapon.</i>

02:59.888 --> 03:05.101
So this is that new weapon,
the germ bomb, Sodom!

03:05.685 --> 03:10.440
<i>If it explodes, it can wipe out all</i>
<i>life forms within a 10-kilometer radius.</i>

03:11.232 --> 03:12.775
I'd like to recover it,

03:12.859 --> 03:16.029
but bringing something of this level
outside would be dangerous...

03:16.529 --> 03:18.531
so I'm just going to eat it.

03:18.615 --> 03:19.616
<i>What?!</i>

03:20.283 --> 03:21.910
What are you doing, Nanao?

03:22.619 --> 03:25.705
<i>Internal organs,</i>
<i>digestive fluids, antibodies...</i>

03:26.206 --> 03:29.334
<i>The human body has a wide array</i>
<i>of detoxification functions.</i>

03:30.460 --> 03:34.881
And my body's are far more effective
than any ordinary person's.

03:35.381 --> 03:37.091
Although that's an industry secret.

03:37.175 --> 03:38.676
<i>Right...</i>

03:38.760 --> 03:40.261
<i>So there's an industry for that.</i>

03:40.929 --> 03:44.724
<i>It'll take me about three hours</i>
<i>to neutralize this amount.</i>

03:45.225 --> 03:47.936
<i>But there's just one problem.</i>

03:48.019 --> 03:49.896
Wh-What is it?

03:49.979 --> 03:52.565
I get really, really sleepy.

03:52.649 --> 03:54.108
<i>Nanao!</i>

03:55.735 --> 03:59.739
<i>Like after I've had a big meal.</i>

03:59.822 --> 04:02.116
Hey, hold up!
Aren't you still undercover?

04:02.492 --> 04:07.330
I put everyone
in this lab to sleep.

04:07.413 --> 04:12.585
I want you to come get me
before anyone from the other labs notices.

04:12.919 --> 04:14.629
Gotcha! I'm on my way!

04:21.094 --> 04:22.178
Where are you?

04:22.262 --> 04:26.724
<i>About five minutes</i>
<i>from Nansei station in Mayoda-ku.</i>

04:26.808 --> 04:27.809
Huh?

04:29.519 --> 04:31.771
<i>Nanao!</i>

04:37.527 --> 04:41.114
<i>I was able to get in easily,</i>
<i>but something's off.</i>

04:58.381 --> 05:00.008
<i>Yeah, this is weird.</i>

05:01.467 --> 05:04.012
<i>The security guards are already injured.</i>

05:05.054 --> 05:06.931
<i>And security's been breached.</i>

05:08.057 --> 05:09.475
<i>Did Nanao do this?</i>

05:09.976 --> 05:13.938
<i>No, that's not the vibe I'm getting.</i>

05:25.116 --> 05:27.285
That was too close for comfort, kid!

05:34.584 --> 05:35.918
Who would have thought?

05:36.002 --> 05:38.379
Are you on a mission, too, Taiyo Asano?

05:39.630 --> 05:41.341
<i>How does he know my name?</i>

05:41.424 --> 05:43.343
What? Taiyo Asano?

05:43.426 --> 05:44.427
Where is he?

05:45.720 --> 05:48.056
Try looking right in front of you,
Mr. Nearsighted.

05:48.139 --> 05:49.599
That's really cold, Sui!

05:49.682 --> 05:53.603
How can you say that when your partner
just lost his glasses in battle?

05:53.686 --> 05:55.688
Feel your forehead, doofus.

05:55.772 --> 05:56.773
Hmm?

05:57.440 --> 05:58.649
Found them!

06:01.027 --> 06:03.863
That moron is my colleague, Oga Inugami.

06:04.405 --> 06:05.990
I'm Sui Aoi.

06:06.074 --> 06:07.241
<i>A business card?</i>

06:07.325 --> 06:08.826
Hey! You're right!

06:08.910 --> 06:10.161
It's Taiyo Asano!

06:10.536 --> 06:13.956
We're with Hinagiku,
a government-operated intelligence unit.

06:14.749 --> 06:15.958
We're government spies.

06:16.876 --> 06:20.004
We were sent to neutralize this lab.

06:20.380 --> 06:23.216
<i>Hinagiku.</i>
<i>I've heard that name before.</i>

06:23.674 --> 06:25.968
<i>Unlike freelance spies like us,</i>

06:26.052 --> 06:28.721
<i>they're elite spies</i>
<i>who operate under government orders.</i>

06:29.305 --> 06:31.391
Oga, what's the status in there?

06:34.060 --> 06:37.980
To the south-southeast,
at a height of minus-47 degrees,

06:38.064 --> 06:39.857
I can hear the footsteps of five people.

06:39.941 --> 06:42.944
I'm catching the scent of
parabellum cartridges. They're armed.

06:43.027 --> 06:44.987
So their base is underground, after all.

06:45.988 --> 06:48.825
Let's do our best
to fulfill our respective missions.

06:48.908 --> 06:50.535
-Now, excuse us.
-Yeah.

06:51.953 --> 06:54.539
No way am I passing up this chance!
We're going together!

06:54.622 --> 06:56.499
The more allies the better, right?

06:56.582 --> 06:57.583
Huh?

06:57.959 --> 07:00.169
Not interested.
You do what you want.

07:00.253 --> 07:02.422
All right!
I want your autograph when we're done!

07:02.505 --> 07:03.714
Rookie sensation!

07:04.841 --> 07:06.801
<i>I've been captured by a weirdo!</i>

07:06.884 --> 07:09.762
<i>But they did just save me.</i>

07:11.556 --> 07:13.891
<i>At the very least, they're not the enemy.</i>

07:19.397 --> 07:24.026
Whoa! Hey, Sui,
he's just as awesome as advertised, huh?

07:28.614 --> 07:31.242
<i>First things first.</i>
<i>I've got to rescue Nanao.</i>

07:38.082 --> 07:40.001
This is the last of the labs.

07:42.545 --> 07:43.546
Nanao!

08:01.981 --> 08:02.982
What are you doing?

08:03.065 --> 08:05.276
No, what are you doing, Taiyo?

08:05.359 --> 08:06.986
It's dangerous, so get out of the way!

08:07.069 --> 08:09.572
Our mission is to kill that guy!

08:09.655 --> 08:10.781
Huh?

08:11.365 --> 08:16.245
Didn't we tell you? That our mission
is to neutralize this lab?

08:16.704 --> 08:19.165
But... why would you kill Nanao?

08:19.665 --> 08:22.919
We didn't mention this before,
but while we were monitoring this lab,

08:23.002 --> 08:25.213
we also listened in on your conversation.

08:26.005 --> 08:29.175
Since he'd already infiltrated this place,

08:29.258 --> 08:31.677
and you had both his location
and infiltration data,

08:31.761 --> 08:33.346
you made this mission a breeze for us.

08:33.429 --> 08:34.555
We thank you for that.

08:35.056 --> 08:38.434
That said, since he's ingested the weapon,
he himself has become the threat.

08:38.518 --> 08:41.687
Eliminating him along with it
would be best for national security.

08:42.021 --> 08:45.650
In other words, once we've killed him,
our mission will be complete.

08:46.234 --> 08:48.110
Now, then, step aside right--

08:48.194 --> 08:50.112
-You're out of your mind.
-Hmm?

08:54.408 --> 08:57.828
If you want to kill my kid brother,
you'll have to kill me first!

08:59.163 --> 09:00.248
Knock it off, Taiyo!

09:03.876 --> 09:05.419
This is a waste of time.

09:06.045 --> 09:08.923
A spy has no need for emotional appeals.

09:20.017 --> 09:23.521
So trusting, you let your guard down
to someone you'd just met.

09:24.021 --> 09:27.525
So lax, you waited to see what we would do
instead of shooting first.

09:28.025 --> 09:29.860
Is this the best
that the Yozakuras can do?

09:31.904 --> 09:34.740
Sui! Why do you do this every time?

09:35.575 --> 09:37.159
Oga.

09:40.496 --> 09:43.040
Don't worry. I won't make him suffer.

09:44.125 --> 09:46.002
W-Wait.

09:47.003 --> 09:49.755
D-Don't do it.

09:50.256 --> 09:52.300
You think you can stop me just by asking?

09:53.092 --> 09:55.553
That's not just pointless,
it's pathetic as well.

09:56.053 --> 09:57.263
Please wait.

10:02.143 --> 10:06.188
I've just finished detoxifying Sodom now.

10:06.814 --> 10:13.070
This patch test is proof that my sweat
doesn't contain any bacterial poison.

10:14.947 --> 10:17.533
If you still intend to kill me...

10:17.617 --> 10:22.121
then at least let me
tend to my brother's wounds first.

10:25.541 --> 10:27.877
If you were able to detoxify it,
we're good.

10:28.377 --> 10:29.712
Our mission is complete.

10:30.588 --> 10:31.922
I'll take this patch test

10:32.006 --> 10:34.175
with me as documentation.

10:35.509 --> 10:37.803
This ointment heals slash wounds.

10:37.887 --> 10:39.639
You can still save him if you act now.

10:40.056 --> 10:42.642
Th-Thank you very much.

10:45.144 --> 10:46.145
Although...

10:46.687 --> 10:48.439
if that was the extent of his skills,

10:48.522 --> 10:50.983
wouldn't it serve the Yozakuras better
if he died?

10:53.486 --> 10:54.820
Let's go, Oga.

10:54.904 --> 10:55.905
Yeah.

11:00.785 --> 11:04.413
Big Bro Taiyo!
Big Bro Taiyo, stay with me!

11:06.082 --> 11:09.335
Big Bro Taiyo! Come on, Big Bro Taiyo!

11:28.813 --> 11:30.731
Do you know why you ended up like this?

11:31.899 --> 11:32.900
"I HAVE NO CLUE!!"

11:32.983 --> 11:34.026
I'm not surprised.

11:34.110 --> 11:37.530
The answer is on the front page
of the spy gossip mag, <i>Spy Day.</i>

11:37.613 --> 11:38.739
<i>"SPY DAY!?"</i>

11:39.198 --> 11:41.617
There's an article
about how you were defeated

11:41.701 --> 11:43.911
by Hinagiku, the government spies,
the other day.

11:43.994 --> 11:47.456
It goes so far as to call it the downfall
of a celebrated family of private spies.

11:48.082 --> 11:51.877
"The perverted firstborn son's
reign of terror is in its last gasps."

11:52.253 --> 11:55.464
This reporter's
not long for this world, eh?

11:56.173 --> 11:58.217
There's also been a spike in review bombs,

11:58.300 --> 12:00.136
so we're kind of
blowing up online right now.

12:00.678 --> 12:03.389
<i>Aren't you the cause of,</i>
<i>like, half of this flaming?</i>

12:03.472 --> 12:06.350
But none of that matters.

12:06.851 --> 12:08.853
The most important thing of all...

12:10.646 --> 12:13.524
is that one false move from you,
and Nanao would've been killed.

12:14.066 --> 12:16.277
Because of your weakness, that is.

12:19.864 --> 12:21.282
Damn Hinagiku.

12:21.365 --> 12:23.534
If you had to kill someone,
you should've gone for--

12:25.244 --> 12:27.288
Apologize to Big Bro Taiyo!

12:27.913 --> 12:29.874
How could you strike your own big brother?

12:29.957 --> 12:31.083
Apologize!

12:31.959 --> 12:33.085
Sorry.

12:41.385 --> 12:43.345
It's okay... Both of you.

12:44.096 --> 12:46.182
The Yozakura name was tarnished...

12:46.682 --> 12:50.060
and Nanao was exposed to danger
because of me.

12:50.853 --> 12:54.565
That's not true!
It was thanks to you that I survived!

12:54.648 --> 12:57.902
No. I couldn't do anything.

12:57.985 --> 12:59.570
Because I'm weak...

13:00.696 --> 13:01.697
Taiyo...

13:07.453 --> 13:08.454
Don't flatter yourself.

13:10.498 --> 13:13.292
The Yozakura family
can't be shaken by your screwup.

13:13.793 --> 13:16.587
<i>Is he</i>
<i>encouraging him or insulting him?</i>

13:17.379 --> 13:19.465
However...

13:20.090 --> 13:24.261
if you intend to take responsibility,
there's just one thing for you to do.

13:24.345 --> 13:28.098
Defeat Hinagiku and restore our good name.

13:37.233 --> 13:39.610
Shut the hell up!
Out of my way! Get lost!

13:40.319 --> 13:42.112
Your legs are what's in the way.

13:42.196 --> 13:43.197
Move.

13:43.280 --> 13:47.159
I can't help it if I've got long legs!
I'll kill you!

13:47.243 --> 13:49.662
Oh, so they're that long?

13:50.371 --> 13:52.832
Your clothes are covering them,
so I can't really tell.

13:53.958 --> 13:56.168
What the hell? You wanna fight?

13:59.171 --> 14:00.256
Scattered Petals.

14:06.053 --> 14:08.180
Damn it! What the hell's going on?

14:09.139 --> 14:11.433
So? What do you want...

14:11.517 --> 14:12.518
Taiyo Asano?

14:14.687 --> 14:16.438
You're far too wary.

14:16.939 --> 14:18.440
You've still got a long way to go.

14:20.818 --> 14:23.362
Are you here to avenge yourself
for the other day?

14:23.821 --> 14:24.822
No--

14:26.699 --> 14:27.700
I...

14:29.869 --> 14:31.662
Restore our good name?

14:31.745 --> 14:36.584
That's right. Hinagiku is a unit of
elite government spies with unique skills.

14:37.418 --> 14:39.795
A war between spies is a war of intel.

14:40.212 --> 14:43.591
If you want to defeat Hinagiku,
steal their intel.

14:44.216 --> 14:45.342
In other words...

14:46.093 --> 14:47.970
<i>spy on the spy.</i>

14:50.097 --> 14:52.808
Just as you say, I'm inexperienced.

14:53.893 --> 14:55.102
That's precisely why...

14:56.270 --> 14:57.688
<i>for my family's sake...</i>

14:58.939 --> 15:03.235
I'm going to learn
the things I need to improve from you.

15:03.736 --> 15:06.572
A spy who announces
that he's tailing someone...

15:06.655 --> 15:08.157
that's new to me.

15:08.824 --> 15:10.743
Well, do whatever you want.

15:12.244 --> 15:13.245
Not that...

15:15.289 --> 15:17.666
I think you stand a chance
of keeping up with me.

15:19.710 --> 15:20.711
<i>He's so fast!</i>

15:22.254 --> 15:25.049
<i>The Hinagiku moving technique,</i>
<i>Walking on Flowers.</i>

15:26.050 --> 15:29.011
<i>It's their secret method</i>
<i>of walking silently at high speeds.</i>

15:30.346 --> 15:33.098
<i>It can be used for infiltration,</i>
<i>tailing, and, needless to say...</i>

15:33.974 --> 15:35.726
<i>in battle.</i>

15:37.186 --> 15:41.065
<i>As one of the Hinagiku squad leaders,</i>
<i>Sui Aoi is particularly skilled at it.</i>

15:41.649 --> 15:44.026
<i>You would have a hard time</i>
<i>even noticing him.</i>

15:44.693 --> 15:45.736
<i>Even so...</i>

15:47.363 --> 15:48.781
DEPARTURE INFORMATION

15:50.574 --> 15:52.576
<i>sink your teeth into him</i>
<i>with sheer willpower!</i>

16:02.419 --> 16:04.463
Farewell, pervert boy.

16:06.090 --> 16:08.676
Hey, you, why don't we
have a little chat in our office?

16:08.759 --> 16:09.885
Huh? Huh?

16:09.969 --> 16:11.220
Huh?

16:12.721 --> 16:15.599
TAILING SUI, DAY 1
"MORNING TRANSPORT MISSION"

16:17.601 --> 16:18.602
Huh?

16:18.852 --> 16:20.104
Taiyo Asano?

16:20.604 --> 16:21.772
What's he doing here?

16:24.274 --> 16:25.901
No!

16:25.985 --> 16:27.319
Oh, my.

16:27.403 --> 16:30.280
TAILING SUI, DAY 3
"LUNCH"

16:34.368 --> 16:35.619
Seriously?

16:42.626 --> 16:45.504
He's leaning on the sword
that he stuck in there.

16:52.302 --> 16:55.806
TAILING SUI, DAY 7
"EVENING EXTERMINATION MISSION"

17:03.188 --> 17:05.024
Hey, look at him!

17:05.107 --> 17:07.776
He's able to follow us until evening now!

17:09.445 --> 17:11.655
That's the spirit!
Keep at it, Taiyo!

17:11.739 --> 17:14.283
All right! Now land a low kick.

17:15.909 --> 17:16.910
Not again.

17:25.461 --> 17:28.005
Don't leave the naughty bits covered!

17:31.216 --> 17:32.259
Whoa!

17:32.718 --> 17:34.136
Me, too?!

17:36.680 --> 17:38.015
I'm home!

17:41.185 --> 17:42.311
Huh?

17:42.394 --> 17:44.104
Where's Big Bro Taiyo?

17:44.188 --> 17:47.983
Oh, he must have had the tables
turned on him by Hinagiku yet again.

17:48.067 --> 17:50.527
He was passed out
by the front door in tatters.

17:51.028 --> 17:54.656
So then you carried him to his room,
Big Bro Kyoichiro?

17:54.740 --> 17:55.741
No.

18:00.162 --> 18:02.289
I thought he'd make
the perfect cutting board--

18:02.372 --> 18:04.917
Why would you make him
even more tattered?

18:05.000 --> 18:06.919
Are you okay, Big Bro Taiyo?

18:09.213 --> 18:11.340
Oh... Hey, Nanao.

18:11.965 --> 18:15.135
They got me again.

18:15.594 --> 18:19.264
Why are you pushing yourself
so hard? You're in such bad shape.

18:19.765 --> 18:21.809
Well, why wouldn't I?

18:22.309 --> 18:24.895
I didn't stand a chance
against those powerful guys,

18:24.978 --> 18:27.648
and to make matters worse,
I couldn't protect my little brother.

18:27.731 --> 18:32.111
I bet you don't want
such a weak, lame big bro, do you?

18:34.113 --> 18:36.615
You don't get it at all,
Big Bro Taiyo.

18:37.783 --> 18:39.535
<i>Always, at any given time...</i>

18:39.618 --> 18:42.412
<i>you always manage to do</i>
<i>what no one could even predict.</i>

18:43.122 --> 18:46.542
<i>There's no way that a big bro like that</i>
<i>could ever be lame.</i>

18:47.835 --> 18:51.880
No matter what anyone else says,
you're cool, Big Bro Taiyo!

18:52.840 --> 18:54.049
Nanao...

18:56.051 --> 18:57.678
Don't be deceived, Nanao.

18:58.178 --> 19:01.306
He just enjoys the habit
of getting slashed and stripped naked.

19:01.390 --> 19:03.058
He's hooked on the thrill of it!

19:05.227 --> 19:08.147
Don't you dare make Big Bro Taiyo
sound like a pervert!

19:08.230 --> 19:09.606
Jeez!

19:10.149 --> 19:11.150
Huh?

19:12.025 --> 19:14.236
Habit?

19:16.446 --> 19:19.825
TAILING SUI, DAY 10
"NIGHTTIME..."

19:27.624 --> 19:28.750
Well, well...

19:29.418 --> 19:31.461
This is my last daily task.

19:32.296 --> 19:36.175
You're the first eccentric who's ever
managed to trail me for a full day.

19:36.842 --> 19:37.843
<i>A rock?</i>

19:38.635 --> 19:40.554
<i>Is it a gravestone, maybe?</i>

19:41.013 --> 19:42.014
<i>But whose?</i>

19:42.389 --> 19:45.017
Out of respect
for your persistence...

19:45.809 --> 19:48.687
I'm going to deliver
the <i>coup de grâce</i> in good faith.

19:49.396 --> 19:52.983
No matter how much work you put into it,
you can never defeat me.

19:53.525 --> 19:56.987
Before you waste
any more of that effort...

19:58.739 --> 20:00.365
I'm going to put an end to this.

20:22.137 --> 20:23.305
<i>He got me.</i>

20:23.889 --> 20:27.059
<i>My body remembers</i>
<i>because of all the times I was struck.</i>

20:27.768 --> 20:31.563
<i>The slashing attack</i>
<i>covers the whole body. But...</i>

20:31.980 --> 20:35.525
<i>the first blow always lands in the center!</i>

20:36.401 --> 20:38.820
<i>I can't see it, and I can't react, either.</i>

20:38.904 --> 20:41.907
<i>But even if I can't beat him...</i>

20:42.866 --> 20:46.745
<i>I can still sink my teeth into him!</i>

20:57.381 --> 20:58.465
<i>I see.</i>

20:59.841 --> 21:03.011
<i>So that's why</i>
<i>the Yozakuras accepted him.</i>

21:07.140 --> 21:08.809
Oga, look after him.

21:09.434 --> 21:10.727
What took you so long?

21:10.811 --> 21:12.479
Don't give me a heart attack!

21:12.562 --> 21:15.565
Man, I was so worried.

21:17.859 --> 21:18.860
GAUZE

21:20.362 --> 21:23.699
Damn, I can't believe
you dodged Sui's sword.

21:23.782 --> 21:24.992
That's impressive!

21:25.409 --> 21:27.244
It's not that he dodged it.

21:27.327 --> 21:29.371
It's just that he realized
what my habits are.

21:29.871 --> 21:33.375
But since he did figure them out,
it's not as if he has no potential.

21:33.834 --> 21:36.003
In that regard,
I'm altering my perception of him.

21:37.045 --> 21:38.422
Sui...

21:45.012 --> 21:46.346
<i>In the end...</i>

21:47.431 --> 21:52.894
<i>the article on how I was outclassed</i>
<i>and defeated by Sui was soon forgotten.</i>

21:53.437 --> 21:54.438
<i>But...</i>

21:54.896 --> 21:56.440
THE PERVERT SPY RANKING
HAS A NEW STAR

21:56.523 --> 21:58.775
THE MYSTERY OF THE SERIAL FLASHER
BORN OF THE YOZAKURAS

22:01.361 --> 22:03.238
SPY DAY

22:04.031 --> 22:07.242
Don't worry.
I love you no matter what, Taiyo.

22:07.743 --> 22:10.495
A-After all, people have
all kinds of habits, right?

22:11.747 --> 22:15.917
This is a misunderstanding!

23:47.300 --> 23:50.887
NEXT TIME
THE KUROYURI PARTY
